Upstream attribution
--------------------
Original project: https://github.com/dseditor/QwenASRMiniTool
The unmodified upstream README is archived at docs/legacy/README_upstream.md.
All GUI wording from the upstream project is preserved; this fork adds a
separate WebView front end and a long-audio streaming path.

Fonts served by Google Fonts are referenced by URL in webview/index.html and
are not embedded in this repository.

